OL,3,APornhub returns to Australia but only
OL,4,Afor adults with Apple devices
OL,5,
OL,6,FPornhub has returned to Australia,
OL,7,Feight months after it went dark due to
OL,8,Fage verification laws, but only adults
OL,9,Fwith Apple devices will be able to
OL,10,Faccess the site.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, parent company Aylo said
OL,13,Fit was restoring access for "eligible
OL,14,Fadult users in Australia" who have
OL,15,F"confirmed their age through Apple's
OL,16,FAustralian age-verification process".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
