OL,3,APornhub returns to Australia but only
OL,4,Afor adults with Apple devices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's biggest porn site left the
OL,7,FAustralian market in March, saying new
OL,8,Flaws requiring users to prove they were
OL,9,Fover 18 would not protect children and
OL,10,F"instead creates harms relating to data
OL,11,Fprivacy" and exposure to content on
OL,12,Fnon-compliant platforms.
OL,14,FApple recently introduced new age
OL,15,Fchecks in Australia, following a
OL,16,Frollout in the UK.
